  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic empowerment of vulnerable women toward social stabilization in eastern Democratic Republic of the Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to contribute to the promotion of social stabilization in DRC, in particular, the east of the country, through directly responding to the COVID-19 pandemic and empowering vulnerable women including SGBV survivors, IDPs, refugees and their host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
